/tmp/paper1609src/Preliminaries.tex:165:																\max(\xx[v_{in_1}]-\xx[v_{in_2}], 0) + \epsilon\right]$ \\
/tmp/paper1609src/Preliminaries.tex:169:		1 \pm \epsilon,  	\,\,\,\,\,\ & \hbox{if $\xx[v_{in_1}]<\xx[v_{in_2}] - \epsilon$;} \\
