../2506.09950/README.md:115:Hinted minus placebo is `0.0`. The one-sentence Fourier/radix-2 hint bought no observed solves, although three trials per arm are too few to estimate a small effect. This suggests the measured obstacle is accurate modular execution after recognizing the change of variables, not only discovering it. Each arm also had two substantive, parsed-but-wrong outcomes, so the result is not solely an output-budget artifact. The shipping answer is 160 characters (about 40 tokens), has 16 atomic elements, and the intended route has 112 exact field operations.
