{"schema_version": 2, "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "effort": "medium", "params": {"n": 8, "q": 31}, "seed": 734263161, "solved": "solved", "parsed": true, "verify_ok": true, "verify_reason": "ok", "reply": "Looking at this problem, I need to set up the value-balance equations for each agent using the cut positions, then solve the resulting linear system.\n\n**Setup:** Writing t_j = 3j+1+x_j with x_j\u2208(0,1), and using y_j=2x_j-1=m_j/31 (m_j integer, since grid is 1/62), each agent's balance condition reduces to:\n\n\u03a3_j (-1)^j w_j m_j = 31\u00b7D_i\n\n**Solving the system:** After eliminating variables through linear combinations of the 8 equations, I find:\n\n- m0 = t-19, m1 = -14-t, m2 = 18+t, m3 = 4+t, m4 = -8-t, m5 = 9+t, m6 = t-2, m7 = t\n\nSubstituting into the R8 equation (which isn't automatically satisfied) determines t=5, giving:\n\nm0=-14, m1=-19, m2=23, m3=9, m4=-13, m5=14, m6=3, m7=5\n\nAll values verified against all 8 original equations successfully.\n\n**Computing cuts:** Using x_j=(m_j+31)/62, t_j = 3j+1+x_j:\n\n- t0 = 1 + 17/62 = 79/62\n- t1 = 4 + 12/62 = 130/31\n- t2 = 7 + 27/31 = 244/31\n- t3 = 10 + 20/31 = 330/31\n- t4 = 13 + 9/31 = 412/31\n- t5 = 16 + 45/62 = 1037/62\n- t6 = 19 + 17/31 = 606/31\n- t7 = 22 + 18/31 = 700/31\n\nAll values lie strictly within their required slots and satisfy the grid condition (62\u00b7t_j integer), and are strictly increasing.\n\n<answer>79/62, 130/31, 244/31, 330/31, 412/31, 1037/62, 606/31, 700/31</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 155.53, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "medium", "escalation_round": 1}
