	%\textbf{Output:} A vertex $x$ such that $P(S(x)) \neq x$ or $S(P(x))\neq x \neq 0^n$.
%\end{problem}	
%A problem is \emph{in} PPAD if it is polynomial-time reducible to {\sc End-Of-Line} and it is PPAD-\emph{complete} if {\sc End-Of-The-Line} reduces to it in polynomial-time.

