- G1–G8 pass, including 0/200,000 random hits and five attacks failing 8/8.
- At the largest in-cap setting (`n=96, q=16,847,121`), one of three oracles still solved it.
- The next fixed-length escalation would require about 2,138 answer characters, exceeding the 2,000-character cap.
- G9 was therefore not run, as required.

